      },
      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Yes, that would be really helpful. I want to return to climbing but don\u2019t want to rush it. What\u2019s good for mild finger swelling recovery?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is some advice for when I start again climbing considering that I had a finger injury?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For mild finger swelling, rest from climbing, use gentle massage, and perform light mobility exercises like finger flexions and squeezing a stress ball. Gradually return to easy climbing only after swelling and pain have resolved. Are you interested in taping techniques for returning to climbing?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0017-96-08323:5": 0.06326767990074442,
