      {
        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "I'm looking for ways to tell the difference between various kinds of finger injuries. Any tips?",
          "user_rubrik": "How can I distinguish different finger injuries?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "Finger sprains are often caused by hyperextension, or bending backward, or a jammed finger from hitting it on something. Broken fingers, or fractures, can be caused by direct trauma to the bone, and are common in sports. They can",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0034-96-17361:1": 4.132469654083252,
            "clueweb22-en0034-96-17361:8": 1.597592830657959,
