          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "1. *   Currently experiencing pain in their left middle finger.",
            "2. *   **Lifestyle/Health:** Currently experiencing or investigating specific symptoms of a climbing-related finger injury. (This is more immediate and specific than the existing \"concerned about finger injuries, likely due to climbing.\")",
            "3. *   Boulders on colder days, which seems to exacerbate their finger pain.",
            "4. I am climbing regularly for the past 3 years.",
            "5. I am left-handed.",
            "6. I climb outdoors.",
            "7. Many years ago I had a bad fall while bouldering."
          ]
