          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "1. - Hobbies/Interests: Is interested in learning about finger injuries (likely related to their climbing hobby).",
            "2. I am climbing regularly for the past 3 years.",
            "3. Many years ago I had a bad fall while bouldering.",
            "4. I climb outdoors."
          ]
