          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "1. - Hobbies/Interests: Is highly motivated to continue climbing, even to the point of considering not fully resting an injury.",
            "2. - Personality: Expresses worry or concern about the implications of their finger injury, specifically regarding the potential for longer recovery periods and its impact on their ability to return to climbing.",
